    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Wurrband",
    "summary": "Give each friendly **ORKS PSYKER** model’s **[[PSYCHIC]](vsdata:weapon-ability/psychic)** attacks +1 **S**. Add a further +1 **S** for each group of 5 models in the bearer’s unit or embarked in the bearer. The model has two **[psychic abilities](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities)**. **Visions of Violence** is available as the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) opens. **Roar of Mork** is available in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase). To use either, the bearer’s unit must be free of **battle-shocked** status. Spend 1 psychic level and make the **[psychic roll](vsdata:core-rule/psychic-abilities)** on a D6. A result of 1 leaves the bearer’s unit **battle-shocked**. With **Roar of Mork**, pick one enemy unit at most 12\" from the bearer’s unit. Exclude **MONSTER** and **VEHICLE** units. The foe takes a **[battle-shock roll](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)**, penalised by 1 for each group of 10 models in the bearer’s unit. With **Visions of Violence**, the bearer’s unit gains **[Fights First](vsdata:core-ability/fights-first)**.",
